# EXCEPTION: the Trends pull is committed. It is only ~350 KB, but it cost
# hours of rate-limited pulling to obtain (Google caps ~19 requests per ~2.5h
# window per IP) and cannot be casually regenerated. Prices are NOT committed —
# they are 26 MB and re-pull from yfinance in about two minutes, unthrottled.
!data/
!data/raw/
!data/raw/trends_single/
!data/raw/trends_single/*.csv
!data/raw/trends_single/manifest.json

